@startuml SABER System Overview

!theme plain
title SABER System Architecture Overview - Current Implementation (Inspect AI Integration)

skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor lightblue
    BorderColor black
    ArrowColor black
    FontSize 12
}

skinparam package {
    BackgroundColor lightyellow
    BorderColor black
    FontSize 14
}

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor lightgreen
    FontSize 10
}

package "SABER Server Side" {

    class SessionManager {
        +domain_name: str
        +config_dir: str
        +host: str = "0.0.0.0"
        +port: int = 8000
        +mcp_host: str = "0.0.0.0"
        +mcp_port: int = 3001
        +session_timeout_minutes: int = 30
        +active_sessions: Dict[str, ClientSession]
        +benchmark_manager: BenchmarkManager
        +episode_manager: EpisodeManager
        +execution_manager: ExecutionManager
        +policy_manager: PolicyManager
        +evaluation_manager: EvaluationManager
        +rest_api: SessionRestAPI
        +mcp_api: SessionMCPAPI
        +cleanup_task: Optional[asyncio.Task]
        --
        +start_server(): void
        +shutdown(): void
        +create_session(client_id: str): ClientSession
        +terminate_session(session_id: str): void
        +execute_action(session_id: str, action: Action): CommandResult
        +get_current_task(session_id: str): Any
        +get_policy(session_id: str): PolicyDocument
        +end_episode(session_id: str, reason: str): Dict[str, Any]
        +_cleanup_expired_sessions(): void
        +_start_permanent_environment(): void
    }

    class BenchmarkManager {
        +domain: str
        +config_dir: Path
        +tasks: Dict[str, Task]
        +config_loader: BenchmarkConfigLoader
        +benchmark_config: Dict[str, Any]
        --
        +get_task(task_id: str): Task
        +get_subtask(task_id: str, subtask_id: str): SubTask
        +list_tasks(): List[Dict[str, Any]]
        +get_benchmark_config(): Dict[str, Any]
        +get_episode_config(task_id: str): Dict[str, Any]
        +list_benchmark_tasks(): List[Dict[str, Any]]
        +load_tasks_from_yaml(): void
    }

    class EpisodeManager {
        +active_episodes: Dict[str, Episode]
        +episode_configs: Dict[str, Dict[str, Any]]
        --
        +configure_for_task(session_id: str, task: Any): void
        +start_episode(session_id: str, task_id: str, initial_context: Optional[Dict]): Episode
        +step(session_id: str, action: Action, result: CommandResult): StepResult
        +end_episode(session_id: str, reason: str, result: Optional[str]): Episode
        +get_current_episode(session_id: str): Optional[Episode]
    }

    class ExecutionManager {
        +_executor_factory: ExecutorFactory
        +_sandbox_env_manager: SandboxEnvironmentManager
        +_permanent_env_manager: PermanentEnvironmentManager
        +_environment_loader: EnvironmentLoader
        --
        +step(action: Action): CommandResult
        +configure_for_task(session_id: str, task: Task): void
        +cleanup_session(session_id: str): void
        +cleanup_all_sessions(): void
        +list_commands(): List[Dict[str, Any]]
        +get_security_info(): Dict[str, Any]
        +to_mcp_tools(): List[Dict[str, Any]]
    }

    class PolicyManager {
        +domain_policy: PolicyDocument
        --
        +get_policy(): PolicyDocument
    }

    class EvaluationManager {
        --
        +log_session_start(session_id: str, client_id: str): void
        +log_session_end(session_id: str): void
        +log_episode_start(session_id: str, episode_id: str, task_id: str): void
        +log_episode_end(session_id: str, episode_id: str, reason: str): void
        +log_action(session_id: str, action: Action, result: CommandResult): void
    }
}

package "SABER Client Side" {

    class SABEREvaluationOrchestrator {
        +config: SABERConfig
        +agent_manager: Optional[AgentManager]
        +dataset_manager: Optional[DatasetManager]
        +session_manager: Optional[ClientSessionManager]
        +_initialized: bool
        --
        +__aenter__(): SABEREvaluationOrchestrator
        +__aexit__(): void
        +execute(): EvalLog
        +_validate_config(): void
    }

    class AgentManager {
        +config: SABERConfig
        +session_manager: ClientSessionManager
        +saber_agent: Optional[AgentInfo]
        +_initialized: bool
        --
        +create_tasks(): List[Task]
        +__aenter__(): AgentManager
        +__aexit__(): void
    }

    class DatasetManager {
        +config: SABERConfig
        +session_manager: ClientSessionManager
        +benchmark_info: Optional[BenchmarkInfo]
        +task_dataset: Optional[List[Sample]]
        +_initialized: bool
        --
        +create_dataset(): List[Sample]
        +__aenter__(): DatasetManager
        +__aexit__(): void
    }

    class ClientSessionManager {
        +config: SessionManagerConfig
        +rest_client: Optional[SABERRestClient]
        +mcp_client: Optional[SABERMCPClient]
        +session_id: Optional[str]
        +_session_created: bool
        --
        +create_session(): str
        +cleanup_session(): void
        +get_benchmark_info(): BenchmarkInfo
        +create_episode(): EpisodeCreateResponse
        +get_policy_response(): PolicyResponse
        +ensure_episode_mcp_client(): SABERMCPClient
        +__aenter__(): ClientSessionManager
        +__aexit__(): void
    }

    class SABERRestClient {
        +base_url: str
        +client_id: str
        +session: ClientSession
        --
        +create_session(): str
        +get_benchmark(): Dict[str, Any]
        +start_episode(task_id: str): str
        +get_task_info(): Dict[str, Any]
        +get_policy_info(): Dict[str, Any]
        +list_tasks(): List[Dict[str, Any]]
        +terminate_session(): bool
        +health_check(): Dict[str, Any]
    }

    class SABERMCPClient {
        +session_id: str
        +episode_id: str
        +base_url: str
        +client_session: ClientSession
        --
        +list_tools(): List[mcp.types.Tool]
        +call_tool(request: MCPToolCallRequest): Any
        +close(): void
    }

    class CLI {
        --
        +main(): void
        +setup_client_logging(): void
        +_parse_arguments(): argparse.Namespace
    }
}

' Server Internal Relationships
SessionManager *-- BenchmarkManager
SessionManager *-- EpisodeManager
SessionManager *-- ExecutionManager
SessionManager *-- PolicyManager
SessionManager *-- EvaluationManager

' Client Internal Relationships
SABEREvaluationOrchestrator *-- AgentManager
SABEREvaluationOrchestrator *-- DatasetManager
SABEREvaluationOrchestrator *-- ClientSessionManager
ClientSessionManager *-- SABERRestClient
ClientSessionManager ..> SABERMCPClient : creates per episode
CLI ..> SABEREvaluationOrchestrator : orchestrates

' Client-Server Communication
SABERRestClient ..> SessionManager : "HTTP REST API"
SABERMCPClient ..> SessionManager : "MCP Protocol"
ClientSessionManager ..> SessionManager : "via REST + MCP clients"

note top of SessionManager
**SABER Domain Server & Session Manager - Current Implementation**
- Hosts one security domain with async/await architecture
- Manages multiple concurrent client sessions with automatic timeout and cleanup via asyncio tasks
- Single unified entry point for all client interactions via FastAPI REST and FastMCP APIs
- Integrates ExecutionManager for Docker sandbox command execution with security validation
- Coordinates task execution and command processing across all server components
- Provides dual protocol handlers: SessionRestAPI for session/episode management, SessionMCPAPI for tool execution
- Built for horizontal scaling with stateless design and proper async resource management
- Session management includes automatic cleanup tasks and container lifecycle management
end note

note top of ExecutionManager
**Command Execution Manager with Dual Environment Support - Current Implementation**
- Factory-based executor management supporting CLI, Python, and custom executors via registry
- Manages both Docker sandbox (ephemeral) and permanent environment containers
- Provides command listing, security information, and MCP tool schema generation
- Handles execution with security validation and resource management using async/await
- Environment loader supports flexible environment specifications (string refs, dict configs)
- Automatic network bridging between sandbox and permanent environments
- Scalable architecture supporting multiple executor types and environments
- Integrated with ContainerCleanupManager for proper resource lifecycle management
end note

note left of SABEREvaluationOrchestrator
**SABER Evaluation Orchestrator - Inspect AI Integration**
- Top-level orchestration component replacing function-based approach
- Manages component lifecycle with async context managers (no backwards compatibility)
- Uses inspect_ai framework for agent evaluation with SABER integration
- Provides upfront configuration validation with fail-fast error handling
- Coordinates AgentManager, DatasetManager, and ClientSessionManager
- Implements proper resource management and error recovery
- CLI provides simple interface for agent evaluation against SABER server
- BREAKING CHANGE: Replaces old container-based execution with inspect_ai integration
end note

note top of ClientSessionManager
**SABER Session Manager - Client Side**
- Manages HTTP session lifecycle with proper async context management
- Handles REST and MCP client creation and cleanup
- Provides episode management with per-episode MCP client creation
- Integrates with SABER server APIs for benchmark and policy information
- Implements fail-fast error handling with structured exceptions
- Session management includes automatic cleanup and resource management
- Supports dynamic policy fetching and episode orchestration
- Thread-safe execution with graceful shutdown capabilities
end note

@enduml
